Package: ShinyADTimeSpace
Title: Shiny Application for AD in Time and Space Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tu", "Hu", email = "UYHDK@leo-pharma.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive Shiny web application for exploring spatial and temporal 
